  "description": "Your little one will experience nothing but the sweetest rides on the Magna Sweetheart 16-inch Girls Bike by Dynacraft. This bike is sure to capture attention with its eye-catching color scheme. The frame features a deep purple paint finish accented by pink handlebars, fork, and training wheels. Colorful details and custom graphics on the handlebar pad, top tube pad, and chain guard are all decked out with pops of yellow, blue, and purple. Coaster brakes make stopping easy and removable/adjustable training wheels help ensure a fun and steady ride for those just learning to ride. The 16-inch tires make this a great option for young riders ages 4-8 years. Spread some love in the neighborhood on the Sweetheart 16-inch Girls Bike.",
